#
msgid ""
msgstr "Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"

msgid "Add Rule"
msgstr "Gehitu araua"

msgid ""
"Add rules to define which profile and entity the user will receive based on "
"their email domain (Optional)."
msgstr ""
"Gehitu arauak erabiltzaileak zein profil eta entitate jasoko dituen posta "
"elektronikoaren domeinuaren arabera definitzeko (Aukerakoa)."

msgid "Automatically create users on first login"
msgstr "Sortu erabiltzaileak automatikoki lehenengo saio-hasieran"

msgid "Configuration updated."
msgstr "Konfigurazioa eguneratu da."

msgid "Default Rule (Fallback)"
msgstr "Arau Lehenetsia (Fallback)"

msgid "Default entity (ELSE)"
msgstr "Entitate lehenetsia (BESTELA)"

msgid "Default profile (ELSE)"
msgstr "Profil lehenetsia (BESTELA)"

msgid "Domain (after @)"
msgstr "Domeinua (@ ondoren)"

msgid "Entity"
msgstr "Entitatea"

msgid "Failed to create the user in GLPI."
msgstr "Ezin izan da erabiltzailea GLPIn sortu."

msgid "Google SSO"
msgstr "Google SSO"

msgid "Google SSO — Configuration"
msgstr "Google SSO — Konfigurazioa"

msgid "Google authentication failed: %s"
msgstr "Google autentifikazioak huts egin du: %s"

msgid "Google login cancelled: %s"
msgstr "Google saio-hasiera bertan behera utzi da: %s"

msgid "Google response without authorization code."
msgstr "Google-ren erantzuna baimen-koderik gabe."

msgid ""
"If the user email does not match any of the rules above, this profile and "
"entity will be used. Mandatory if automatic creation is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzailearen helbide elektronikoa aurreko arauekin bat ez badator, "
"profil eta entitate hau erabiliko dira. Derrigorrezkoa sorrera automatikoa "
"gaituta badago."

msgid "Invalid OAuth2 state. Try again from the login page."
msgstr "OAuth2 egoera baliogabea. Saiatu berriro saio-hasiera orritik."

msgid "Leave blank to keep current secret (stored encrypted)."
msgstr "Utzi hutsik uneko sekretua mantentzeko (enkriptatuta gordeta)."

msgid "No GLPI user corresponds to this Google account."
msgstr "Ez dago GLPI erabiltzailerik Google kontu honi dagokiona."

msgid "Only accounts from the %s domain are accepted."
msgstr "%s domeinuko kontuak soilik onartzen dira."

msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Profila"

msgid "Profile and Entity Rules by Domain"
msgstr "Profil eta Entitate Arauak Domeinuaren arabera"

msgid "Register this Redirect URI in Google Cloud Console:"
msgstr "Erregistratu birbideratze-URI hau Google Cloud Console-n:"

msgid "Restrict to domain (optional)"
msgstr "Mugatu domeinura (aukerakoa)"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Gorde"

msgid "Select..."
msgstr "Hautatu..."

msgid "Session not initialized: user has no enabled profile."
msgstr "Saioa ez da hasi: erabiltzaileak ez du gaitutako profilik."

msgid "Sign in with Google"
msgstr "Hasi saioa Google-rekin"

msgid "The Google account does not have a verified email."
msgstr "Google kontuak ez du egiaztatutako posta elektronikorik."

msgid "This user is deactivated in GLPI."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile hau GLPIn desgaituta dago."

msgid "or"
msgstr "edo"

msgid ""
"Leave the option <strong>\"Remove domain of logins in form "
"login@domain\"</strong> as <strong>No</strong>. If enabled, users with the "
"same prefix in different providers (e.g., admin@gmail.com and "
"admin@institution.edu.br) will suffer account overlap."
msgstr ""
"Utzi <strong>\"Kendu saio-hasieraren domeinua login@domain "
"formularioan\"</strong> aukera <strong>Ez</strong> gisa. Gaituta badago, "
"hornitzaile ezberdinetan aurrizki bera duten erabiltzaileek (adibidez, "
"admin@gmail.com eta admin@institution.edu.br) kontua gainjartzea jasango "
"dute."

msgid ""
"Check the <strong>Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button</strong> option "
"below and click <strong>Save</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Egiaztatu beheko <strong>Aktibatu \"Hasi saioa Google-rekin\" "
"botoia</strong> aukera eta sakatu <strong>Gorde</strong>."

msgid ""
"Change the <strong>Automatically add users from an external authentication "
"source</strong> field to <strong>Yes</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Aldatu <strong>Gehitu erabiltzaileak automatikoki kanpoko autentifikazio-"
"iturburu batetik</strong> eremua <strong>Bai</strong>."

msgid "Step 1: Google Cloud Preparation"
msgstr "1. urratsa: Google Cloud prestatzea"

msgid "Critical Warning:"
msgstr "Abisu kritikoa:"

msgid "How to enable Google SSO integration?"
msgstr "Nola gaitu Google SSO integrazioa?"

msgid ""
"Google will generate a <strong>Client ID</strong> and a <strong>Client "
"Secret</strong>. Fill in the fields in this form with those keys."
msgstr ""
"Google-k <strong>Bezero IDa</strong> eta <strong>Bezeroaren "
"sekretua</strong> sortuko ditu. Bete formulario honetako eremuak gako "
"horiekin."

msgid ""
"Access the <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Google Cloud Console</a> and create a new "
"<strong>Project</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Sartu <a href=\"https://console.cloud.google.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Google"
" Cloud Console</a> eta sortu <strong>Proiektu</strong> berri bat."

msgid "Redirect URI:"
msgstr "Birbideratzeko URIa:"

msgid "Activate \"Sign in with Google\" button"
msgstr "Aktibatu \"Hasi saioa Google-rekin\" botoia"

msgid ""
"Then go to <strong>Credentials &gt; Create Credentials &gt; OAuth client "
"ID</strong>, choosing the <strong>Web application</strong> type."
msgstr ""
"Ondoren, joan <strong>Kredentzialak &gt; Sortu kredentzialak &gt; OAuth "
"bezero ID</strong>, <strong>Web aplikazioa</strong> mota aukeratuz."

msgid "Step 2: GLPI Authentication Preparation"
msgstr "2. urratsa: GLPI autentifikazioa prestatzea"

msgid ""
"Go to <strong>APIs &amp; Services &gt; OAuth consent screen</strong> and "
"configure your app (add the scopes <code>email</code>, <code>profile</code>,"
" and <code>openid</code>)."
msgstr ""
"Joan <strong>APIak &amp; Zerbitzuak &gt; OAuth baimenaren pantaila</strong> "
"eta konfiguratu aplikazioa (gehitu esparruak <code>posta "
"elektronikoa</code>, <code>profila</code> eta <code>openid</code>)."

msgid "In GLPI, go to <strong>Setup &gt; Authentication &gt; Setup</strong>."
msgstr ""
"GLPIn, joan <strong>Konfigurazioa &gt; Autentifikazioa &gt; "
"Konfigurazioa</strong>."

msgid ""
"Under <strong>Authorized redirect URIs</strong>, copy and paste exactly the "
"return URL below:"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Baimendutako birbideratze URIak</strong> atalean, kopiatu eta "
"itsatsi zehatz-mehatz itzultzeko URLa behean:"
